CodeSystem: BeCSTaskCode
Id: be-cs-taskcode
Title: "BREW Task Codes"
Description: "Task codes defined for Belgian workflows, for use in `Task.code` when neither the FHIR task-code CodeSystem nor the COW Task codes cover the workflow step. Each code must be agreed by the FHIR Validation Team before it is added."
